Project-owned scalar kernels and numerical compatibility layer.

Numerical algorithms adapted from:
- TensorFlow Lite Micro, revision 9f638f18154dff868e7053572f089be845b2fbdf:
  tensorflow/lite/kernels/internal/common.{h,cc}, reference/softmax.h,
  reference/integer_ops/{conv,fully_connected,add,pooling}.h and reference/requantize.h.
  Copyright The TensorFlow Authors. Apache License 2.0.
- Gemmlowp scalar fixed-point algorithms from the pinned TFLM downloads:
  fixedpoint/fixedpoint.h, Copyright 2015 The Gemmlowp Authors.
  Apache License 2.0.

Only the scalar INT32 numerical contract and supported static operator subsets
are ported. The original pinned implementations remain independent test oracles.
No runtime TFLM, ruy or gemmlowp source is required by the standalone backend.
